abstract: "Anonymous source code, canonical instances, pseudonymous numerical questionnaire answers and results for finite-endpoint credibility models and minimax OWA routing. Release 12.0.0 preserves all v11 records and adds certified interpolation, a neutral completion family and expert strata; release 11.0.1 added a piecewise-linear benchmark using the same endpoint information and two separately reported stress completions. Complete-membership validation and certified/exploratory sweep qualification are retained. Inherited questionnaire and solver studies are identified separately; original completed PDF forms are not included."
